Subject: More time to reserve for Life drawing for beginners

Reservations now close Fri, Nov 13 at 10 AM (New York time)

Hi Priya,

The organizer moved the deadline for Life drawing for beginners from Thu, Nov 12 at 10 AM (New York time) to Fri, Nov 13 at 10 AM (New York time), so more people have time to reserve. It can move only once.

If 3 people reserve by then, holds are charged and the class is on. If not, every hold is released and nobody pays.

When: Sat, Nov 14, 10 AM–12 PM (New York time)
Where: The Long Room · Red Hook, Brooklyn
Price: $45

Your spot stays as it is. Until charging starts, you can still leave and have any hold released from the private link you got when you joined.

--
The class happens, or nobody pays.
You get this because you left your email when you joined Life drawing for beginners on CommitPool.

